# Haruka Prefab v1
# Audio test probe (Docs/Audio_Design.md). A small sphere that loops Test_BeepLoop.wav.
# Spawn it from the content browser, press Play, then move the camera to hear panning and distance.
NAME:AudioProbe
POS:0.9 0.35 1.2
ROT:0 0 0
SCALE:0.3 0.3 0.3
ACTIVE:1
PRIM:sphere|32x16|0|0.0000
PRIM_MAT:color 4DD966FF 0 0.4
MESH_STATE:1 1
AUDIO:assets/audio/Test_BeepLoop.wav
AUDIO_VOL:1 1 1 1
AUDIO_3D:1 inverse 1 100 1
